Package: regInspect
Type: Package
Title: Regression Inspector
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-09-02
Authors@R: c(person("Ravi", "Selker", role=c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Jonathon", "Love", role=c("aut", "cph"), email="jon@thon.cc"),
    person("Damian", "Dropmann", role=c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Victor", "Moreno", role=c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email="v.moreno@iconcologia.net"))
Maintainer: Victor Moreno <v.moreno@iconcologia.net>
Description: A clone of jmv's Linear Regression analysis, with descriptive
    scatter plots added throughout. The Estimated Marginal Means plots gain
    observed-data points (partial residuals by default, so they stay
    coherent with the adjusted y axis of a multiple regression, or raw
    values on request) and prediction intervals alongside the existing
    confidence intervals. A separate Plots tab adds model-free descriptive
    views of the analysed variables: the dependent variable against each
    covariate and by each factor, an optional colour-by group, and a
    scatterplot matrix -- all annotated in the same style as corrInspect's
    scatterplots (r, fitted line, confidence/prediction bands).
